+// 4. Log the run (records written, snapshot_date) so your pages can show freshness.
+```
+
+`wfa_skill_gap_analysis.department_id` is **NOT NULL** and your employee table is the source of truth
+for department ids — resolve it from `skill_snapshots[].department_id` (L&D already joins
+`em_departments` for you) instead of trusting the free-text `target_department` strings.
