+Use it to close the loop on your own pages instead of assuming L&D ignored you:
+
+- `counts` — per dataset totals + `*_open` (still action-needed) counts. Good stat cards.
+- `datasets.<key>.records[]` — current status of each record you sent, with `status_label`.
+- `requests[]` — follow-up training requests L&D raised from your records
+  (`external_reference_id` is `competency:<id>` / `turnover_risk:<id>`, i.e. **the id L&D assigned**,
+  not your `external_reference_id` — match on the record id inside that value).
+- `events[]` — audit trail of every status move and request, so you can show "L&D moved risk #2 to
+  Mitigated on 2026-09-25". `since` narrows this list only; the record lists are always current.
